{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011LoHwkRrxttPuNq1aB8WmL","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Cloudflare Agents SDK subAgent deprecated\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"github cloudflare/agents agents@0.23.0\",\"url\":\"https://newreleases.io/project/github/cloudflare/agents/release/agents@0.23.0\"},{\"title\":\"2026 06 26 agents sdk v0.17.0\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/post/2026-06-26-agents-sdk-v0.17.0/\"},{\"title\":\"developers.cloudflare.com\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/30/\"},{\"title\":\"developers.cloudflare.com\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/product-group/developer-platform/18/\"},{\"title\":\"nx7kq-digitalcore-9471.duckdns.org\",\"url\":\"https://nx7kq-digitalcore-9471.duckdns.org/changelog/24/\"},{\"title\":\"2025 03 18 npm i agents\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/post/2025-03-18-npm-i-agents/\"},{\"title\":\"developers.cloudflare.com\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/post/2025-03-18-npm-i-agents/index.md\"},{\"title\":\"developers.cloudflare.com\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/agents/api-reference/sub-agents/index.md\"},{\"title\":\"Agents, Workers - npm i agents\",\"url\":\"https://feedbagel.com/post/agents-workers-npm-i-agents\"},{\"title\":\"c003c2a4.preview.developers.cloudflare.com\",\"url\":\"https://c003c2a4.preview.developers.cloudflare.com/changelog\"}]\n\nThe search turned up one relevant finding. In a release note for `agents@0.23.0`, the `subAgent()`, `abortSubAgent()`, `deleteSubAgent()`, `hasSubAgent()`, and `listSubAgents()` methods are marked deprecated but still work. Their behavior is unchanged, and they now route through the same underlying capability. SubAgentClass and SubAgentStub remain as compatibility aliases. This is a third-party mirror of the GitHub release notes, so check the official repo or changelog before relying on it.\n\nOther notes:\n- The official sub-agents API reference still shows `this.subAgent(...)` as the standard pattern, with no deprecation notice in the snippet I saw (the example code for Orchestrator and Researcher agents).\n- The `v0.17.0` changelog adds background sub-agent runs through `runAgentTool`, which returns a handle immediately. This is a separate feature from the `subAgent()` deprecation.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7601e32b-ebec-419a-87d5-31f24471eff1","uuid":"dc206cfa-79f0-4352-beae-3574ea023fd0","timestamp":"2026-10-11T03:14:32.001Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Cloudflare Agents SDK subAgent deprecated","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01VKbKQnAuwsSShMyZdy8Et7","content":[{"title":"github cloudflare/agents agents@0.23.0","url":"https://newreleases.io/project/github/cloudflare/agents/release/agents@0.23.0"},{"title":"2026 06 26 agents sdk v0.17.0","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/post/2026-06-26-agents-sdk-v0.17.0/"},{"title":"developers.cloudflare.com","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/30/"},{"title":"developers.cloudflare.com","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/product-group/developer-platform/18/"},{"title":"nx7kq-digitalcore-9471.duckdns.org","url":"https://nx7kq-digitalcore-9471.duckdns.org/changelog/24/"},{"title":"2025 03 18 npm i agents","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/post/2025-03-18-npm-i-agents/"},{"title":"developers.cloudflare.com","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/post/2025-03-18-npm-i-agents/index.md"},{"title":"developers.cloudflare.com","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/agents/api-reference/sub-agents/index.md"},{"title":"Agents, Workers - npm i agents","url":"https://feedbagel.com/post/agents-workers-npm-i-agents"},{"title":"c003c2a4.preview.developers.cloudflare.com","url":"https://c003c2a4.preview.developers.cloudflare.com/changelog"}]},"The search turned up one relevant finding. In a release note for `agents@0.23.0`, the `subAgent()`, `abortSubAgent()`, `deleteSubAgent()`, `hasSubAgent()`, and `listSubAgents()` methods are marked deprecated but still work. Their behavior is unchanged, and they now route through the same underlying capability. SubAgentClass and SubAgentStub remain as compatibility aliases. This is a third-party mirror of the GitHub release notes, so check the official repo or changelog before relying on it.\n\nOther notes:\n- The official sub-agents API reference still shows `this.subAgent(...)` as the standard pattern, with no deprecation notice in the snippet I saw (the example code for Orchestrator and Researcher agents).\n- The `v0.17.0` changelog adds background sub-agent runs through `runAgentTool`, which returns a handle immediately. This is a separate feature from the `subAgent()` deprecation."],"durationSeconds":5.147188600000001,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_011LoHwkRrxttPuNq1aB8WmL","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
